    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d272">

                <pb facs="0339" n="323" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg323"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.911/10–1547: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Assistant Secretary of State for American Republic
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Publisher of “La Prensa”</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gainza
                        Paz</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-15">October 15,
                        1947</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Please accept my congratulations on the occasion of <hi rendition="#italic">La
                        Prensa’s</hi> seventy-eighth anniversary.</p>
                <p>The prestige which your paper has achieved through its continued maintenance of
                    the highest standards of journalism reserves for it a <pb facs="0340" n="324"
                        xml:id="pg324"/> special place among the great newspapers of the world. I
                    take this opportunity to wish <hi rendition="#italic">La Prensa</hi> and you
                    many more years of distinguished public service.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Norman Armour</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
